---
title: "cli_relay_price_update (Pyth Sui Price Feeds: Use Real-Time Data)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_parse_args: parse feed-id, hermes url, full-node url, pyth-state-id, wormhole-state-id
    q_parse_args --> q_fetch_hermes: fetch update data from Hermes for given feed-id
    q_fetch_hermes --> q_connect_sui: connect to Sui full node
    q_connect_sui --> q_build_tx: build programmable transaction with price update
    q_build_tx --> q_sign: sign transaction with SUI_KEY
    q_sign --> q_submit: submit transaction to Sui network
    q_submit --> q_check_result: check transaction effects
    q_check_result --> q_success: transaction succeeded
    q_check_result --> q_failure: transaction failed
    q_success --> [*]: return success
    q_failure --> [*]: return error

    note right of q_parse_args
        INV-001: SUI_KEY environment variable must be set (private key)
        INV-002: feed-id must be a valid Pyth price feed identifier
    end note

    note right of q_fetch_hermes
        INV-003: Hermes endpoint must be reachable and return signed VAA
        INV-004: Use hermes-beta for testnet, hermes.pyth.network for mainnet
    end note

    note right of q_sign
        INV-005: Signing key must have sufficient SUI balance for gas
    end note
